        "content": "<p>Joysway has produced a wide and varying range of RC boats. From their speed boats to their sailing boats and through to their bait boats you will find an RC boat for you. Whether you want a boat for purely leisure time activities or are looking at yachts for racing we have a great range to choose from at Hearns Hobbies.</p><p>Joysway RC boats come in a range of sizes, speeds and abilities and come either RTR (Ready to Run) or require some further equipment in order to run. Check out the model or version which suits you best.</p><p>We also have an extensive range of spare parts available for all of these boats. </p>",
